# LF everywhere, whatever core.autocrlf says. Migrations are pinned by the SHA-256 of their exact
# bytes (scripts/db/migrate-supabase.mjs MANIFEST), and deploy/aws/*.sh run under bash on Linux;
# a CRLF checkout would break both.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.xlsx binary
# Synthetic import corpus: pinned by SHA-256 in pilot/synthetic-corpus/manifest.json; CSV lines
# end in CRLF (RFC 4180), so keep the exact bytes.
pilot/synthetic-corpus/*.csv -text
